        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-54" connectable="0" parent="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-45" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" value="Discrimination&amp;nbsp;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.1428" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-49" edge="1" parent="1" source="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-38" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;curveGeometry=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-48" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-55" connectable="0" parent="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-49" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" value="Discrimination&amp;nbsp;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.0995" y="-2" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-38" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Is it discrimination or undo burden?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="230" x="-800" y="630" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-43" edge="1" parent="1" source="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-40" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;curveGeometry=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-42" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-40" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Undue burdens on interstate commerce&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Pike&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;A nondiscriminatory state law serving a legitimate local interest is unconstitutional if its burden on interstate commerce is &lt;u&gt;clearly excessive&lt;/u&gt; in relation to its putative local benefits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Consider:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- The nature and magnitude of the interstate burden.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- The asserted local benefits and evidence supporting them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Whether incompatible state requirements obstruct interstate transportation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Whether the interest could be served with less interference.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Example:&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Kassel:&amp;nbsp;I&lt;/i&gt;owa’s truck-length restrictions forced interstate carriers to change equipment&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="450" x="-1180" y="760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-42" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;out-of-state effects do not, by themselves, make a law unconstitutional.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;National Pork Producers&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;In-state sales requirement with effects elsewhere: not automatically invalid.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Direct command governing unrelated transactions entirely elsewhere: exceeds the state’s territorial authority.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="360" x="-1220" y="1055" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-47" edge="1" parent="1" source="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-44" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;curveGeometry=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-46" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-44" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;State participation in the market&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Reeves&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;When a state acts as a buyer or provider of goods or services in a market, it generally may favor its own residents without violating the dormant Commerce Clause&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="350" x="-220" y="560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-46" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Downstream restrictions&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;South-Central Timber Development v. Wunnicke&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Alaska sold state-owned raw timber. As a condition of buying it, purchasers had to agree to have a specified percentage processed in Alaska.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Selling timber with preferential treatment was allowed, but&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) requiring processing to occur in Alaska was not.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="340" x="290" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ltZLwBbUF2npR7WB0Q-s-48" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Congressional Statue Ex&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;emption&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;Prudential Insurance v. Benjamin&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Congress possesses the affirmative commerce power. When it authorizes the challenged discrimination, the judicially inferred dormant limitation gives way.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Taxation of insurance including discrimination is allowed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="127.5" width="350" x="-610" y="423" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="LRDWLJveA82CAuhTjQ3T" name="Main">
    <mxGraphModel dx="4537" dy="2208" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-27" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Section 25 of the Judiciary Act&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Martin v. Hunter&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;&quot;&gt;SCOTUS may review a state supreme court judgment involving federal law.&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;land title case in Virginia&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;The Virginia Court of Appeals refused to obey the Supreme Court&#39;s mandate, arguing that because the state was an independent sovereign, its state court judgments were completely unreviewable by any federal court&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Justice Story&amp;nbsp;upheld the constitutionality of Section 25, ruling that Article III&#39;s grant of federal appellate power and the necessity for national uniformity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Because:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Structure of the Constitution: without appellate review Supreme Court would be limited to original jurisdiction and rendered weak.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) Uniformity of federal law throughout the states&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) Safeguarding Federal Rights, States only take local interests into account. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="370" x="-1620" y="740" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e3ATHgwVvUqlWDtMOqMw-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="etZlYf6G8s0ghMiELZu9-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="e3ATHgwVvUqlWDtMOqMw-1" value="">
