          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-25" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Declaring a Statute Unconstitutional&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Trump v. Casa&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- federal unconstitutional injunctions can only provide protection for actual plantifs not affected parties unless class action, because&amp;nbsp;law is unconstitutional not that it&#39;s void.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Only thing stopping executive branch from abusing the&amp;nbsp;party-specific injunction is the class wide actions providing actual universal relief.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="177.5" width="320" x="-600" y="1260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-51" edge="1" parent="1" source="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-48" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-50" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-54" edge="1" parent="1" source="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-48" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-27">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-56" edge="1" parent="1" source="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-27" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-55" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-58" edge="1" parent="1" source="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-48" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-57" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-48" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;(2)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Statutory Authorization&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Congress must affirmatively confer that jurisdiction on the federal courts by statute:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- The Judiciary Act of 1789&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="350" x="-1120" y="870" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-52" edge="1" parent="1" source="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-50" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-25">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-50" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Section 13 of the Judiciary Act&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Marbury v. Madison&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Did Marbury have a right to his commission?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Because President Adams had signed the commission and Marshall had fixed the seal the appointment was fixed, delivery was not important.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) Did the law afford him a remedy?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Yes, Distinguishing between political discretionary acts, and ministerial duties, a writ of mandamus was the appropriate remedy&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) Could the Supreme Court issue this remedy?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;No, because the original jurisdiction of A3 §2 was contradictory to Section 13 of the Judiciary act, and the constitution was the supreme law of the land. Thus Section 13 of JA was struck down&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Basically, the Supreme Court was weak at the time and would have lost a direct battle so this was a light slap on the wrist without claiming any actual power.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="323.75" width="400" x="-710" y="846.25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-55" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;State statute&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Fletcher&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;v. Peck&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Federal courts may declare a state statute unconstitutional in a case originating in federal court.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="350" x="-1760" y="1170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-57" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Appellete level review for cases where a state is a party&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Cohens v. Virginia&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Even thought jurisdiction came through &quot;arising under&quot; jurisdiction Virginia argued that because the state was a party SCOTUS only had original jurisdiction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;SCOTUS overruled and said they still have Appellate level of review.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="350" x="-1170" y="1100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-63" edge="1" parent="1" source="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-60" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-62" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-60" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Defiance of federal Injunction&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Ex parte Young (1908)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Judicial Contempt:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Which typically for States violate the 11th amendment, however the legal fiction that when a state officer attempts to enforce an unconstitutional law, they are acting outside the scope of their lawful state authority and are not &quot;the state&quot;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Limits: Only future actions, not previous ones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="177.5" width="320" x="-700" y="1510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C7ZAWZG5jA59ftulppse-62" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;11th Amendment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- federal courts cannot adjudicate any private, unconsenting lawsuit against a state government, regardless of the plaintiff&#39;s citizenship&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="310" x="-1090" y="1460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="scOSfk2M4ij6awWxsxpC" name="History">
    <mxGraphModel dx="841" dy="665" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="7r9usTJk30h9aJTtRAM1-3" edge="1" parent="1" source="7r9usTJk30h9aJTtRAM1-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="7r9usTJk30h9aJTtRAM1-2" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7r9usTJk30h9aJTtRAM1-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Articles of Confederation&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Preemptive gov structure to our modern-day constitution, federal govemert was weak because:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) No ability to tax&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) No ability to make treaties&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) No adjudication between states&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="350" x="260" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7r9usTJk30h9aJTtRAM1-2" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0px 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Constitutional Convention&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Two main points of contention:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) Representation in national legislature&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- By state or population&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;(2) Future of slavery was the sub context with the dual&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;approach in congress and presidential election. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- limitations on direct taxation, including that on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;property &quot;Slaves&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="350" x="260" y="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
